   "t": 2554.5,
   "fen": "rnbqkbnr/pp2pppp/8/3p4/3pP3/2P5/PP3PPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 4",
   "line": [
    "d5"
   ],
   "spoken": "A quick opening overview — I won't reveal all my secrets, but a few things. When I say d5 is rare...",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 5,
   "t": 2562,
   "fen": "rnbqkbnr/pp1ppppp/8/8/3pP3/2P5/PP3PPP/RNBQKBNR b KQkq - 0 3",
   "line": [],
   "spoken": "...I don't mean five games — compared to accepting the Morra with a knight to f6, d5 is fourth in popularity.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 6,
   "t": 2572,
   "fen": "rnbqkbnr/pp2pppp/8/3p4/3pP3/2P5/PP3PPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 4",
   "line": [
    "d5"
   ],
   "spoken": "Twenty-one thousand games for the capture, two thousand for d5. What do most players do?",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 7,
   "t": 2573.5,
   "fen": "rnbqkbnr/pp2pppp/8/3P4/3p4/2P5/PP3PPP/RNBQKBNR b KQkq - 0 4",
   "line": [
    "exd5"
   ],
   "spoken": "Most play the capture on d5, and now...",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
