   "fen": "rnbqkb1r/pp2pppp/5n2/3P4/3p4/2P5/PP3PPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 1 5",
   "line": [
    "Nf6"
   ],
   "spoken": "...Black's idea is a knight to f6, a really tricky position where White can easily be worse.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 9,
   "t": 2587,
   "fen": "rnbqkb1r/pp2pppp/5n2/3P4/3P4/8/PP3PPP/RNBQKBNR b KQkq - 0 5",
   "line": [
    "cxd4"
   ],
   "spoken": "The most common move is the capture on d4.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 10,
   "t": 2591,
   "fen": "rnbqkb1r/pp2pppp/8/3n4/3P4/8/PP3PPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 6",
   "line": [
    "Nxd5"
   ],
   "spoken": "Which leads, after the knight recapture on d5...",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 11,
   "t": 2592.5,
   "fen": "rnbqkb1r/pp2pppp/8/3n4/3P4/2N5/PP3PPP/R1BQKBNR b KQkq - 1 6",
   "line": [
    "Nc3"
   ],
   "spoken": "...a knight to c3, a knight to c6, a knight to f3...",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 13,
   "t": 2594.5,
   "fen": "r1bqkb1r/pp2pppp/2n5/3n4/3P4/2N2N2/PP3PPP/R1BQKB1R b KQkq - 3 7",
   "line": [
    "Nc6",
    "Nf3"
   ],
   "spoken": "...to a position that can arise from the Caro-Kann Panov Attack.",
