  },
  {
   "ply": 14,
   "t": 2613.5,
   "fen": "r2qkb1r/pp2pppp/2n5/3n1b2/3P4/2N2N2/PP3PPP/R1BQKB1R w KQkq - 4 8",
   "line": [
    "Bf5"
   ],
   "spoken": "After a knight to f3, a bishop to g4 is a known theoretical line, but I really like a bishop to f5 — Black is great here.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 15,
   "t": 2623,
   "fen": "r2qkb1r/pp2pppp/2n5/3n1b2/3P4/1QN2N2/PP3PPP/R1B1KB1R b KQkq - 5 8",
   "line": [
    "Qb3"
   ],
   "spoken": "So much so that if White plays a queen to b3, the theoretical answer to the bishop-g4 line...",
